<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="martialarts.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="martialarts">
    <!-- §8.1 gate-blocker backlog: the martial-arts STYLE DESCRIPTION popup
         (ma_style_callback::key, SHOW_DESCRIPTION). The style PICKER itself is a
         uilist (Tier-0); this doc is only the scrolling description that opens
         over it. A single text pane: the colour-tagged style writeup
         (replace_colors → cata_text_to_rml), wrapped natively, scrolled by
         UP/DOWN/PAGE. The curses border title + scrollbar are dropped (semantic
         rewrite); native RmlUi scroll replaces the line-offset windowing.
         Static for the view → model built once at open. Render-only. -->
    <div class="panel ma-panel">
        <div class="ma-title" data-rml="title_rml"></div>
        <div id="ma-body" class="ma-body scroll-pane" data-rml="body_rml"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
